   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-07-10",
   "text": "Restroom Access Act of 2023\n This bill requires retailers to allow a customer to use a nonpublic restroom if the customer has an eligible medical condition (e.g., inflammatory bowel disease) that requires immediate access to a restroom and other conditions are met."
  }
